DISSIDENTS.

CIVIL WAR HAS ERUPTED IN CYPRUS. IN ACCORDANCE WITH U.N. RESOLUTION 
9765-483, NATO PEACE KEEPING FORCES HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO THE 
REGION. 

THE 14TH CAV AS PART OF A NATO RAPID DEPLOYMENT READY GROUP HAS
BEEN AMONG THE FIRST TO ARRIVE IN COUNTRY. 

OVER TWO WEEKS OF INTENSE BUT ISOLATED FIGHTING HAS LED TO THE 
14THS INCLUSION IN THE CONFLICT. 

1ST PLT (ECHO CO) HAS BEEN ISSUED ORDERS TO RELINQUISH IT'S DUG 
IN POSITION AND ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 067ø EAST AND NORTH. 
YOUR MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO AID 2ND PLT IN ELIMINATING REBEL 
ENCLAVES CONTROLLING THE NORTH/EAST CORRIDOR. 

2ND PLT, ALREADY CAUGHT IN BATTLE, IS ORDERED TO PROCEED ON A 
COURSE HEADING OF 083ø EAST AND SOUTH THROUGH REBEL CONTROLLED 
TERRITORY. YOUR MISSION OBJECTIVE IS THE EXPEDIENT REMOVAL OF THE 
REBEL FORWARD COMMAND BASE.
